		'Autoclose is independent of spawn kind; promotion changes only autoclose, and queued human follow-ups retain it. The first prompt of a fresh session preserves its explicitly configured autoclose, so an atomic create/tab-new autoclose option can start CLI jobs. Changes persist as output history records and metadata pushes, without steering active provider work.',
